    {
     "role": "running-head",
     "text": "216           TWENTY-FIFTH CONGRESS.  SESS. II. CH. 54.   1838."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "All causes"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "transferred"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "from said dist."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "courts to circuit"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "court at Lewis-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "burg, removed"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "back, &c."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "SEC. 2. And be it further enacted, That all causes transferred by"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "authority of said act from the said district courts to the circuit court,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "directed by law to be held in the town of Lewisburg, in the State of"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "Virginia, and which remain undetermined, be removed back to the"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "district courts from whence they were transferred, to be there finally"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "determined."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Appellate ju-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "risdiction from"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "said dist. courts"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "to be exercised"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "by circuit court"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "at Lewisburg."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "SEC. 3. And be it further enacted, That appellate jurisdiction from"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "the judgments or decrees of the said district courts of the western dis-"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "trict of Virginia, as now authorized by law, shall be exercised by the"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "said circuit court at Lewisburg."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "APPROVED, March 28, 1838."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "STATUTE II."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "April 6, 1838."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "[Obsolete.]"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "CHAP. LIV.—An Act making appropriations for the civil and diplomatic expenses"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "of Government for the year eighteen hundred and thirty-eight."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "Be it enacted by the Senate and House of Representatives of the"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "United States of America in Congress assembled, That the following"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "sums be, and the same are hereby, appropriated, to be paid out of any"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "unappropriated money in the treasury, viz:"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Pay and mile-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "age of members"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "of Congress."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For pay and mileage of the members of Congress and delegates,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "five hundred and sixty-seven thousand six hundred and eighty dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Pay of officers,"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "&c., of Con-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "gress."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For pay of the officers and clerks of the Senate and House of Repre-"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "sentatives, forty thousand four hundred dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Contingent"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "exp. of Senate."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For stationery, fuel, printing, and all other contingent expenses of"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "the Senate, fifty thousand dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Contingent"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "expenses of Ho."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Reps."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For stationery, fuel, printing, and all other contingent expenses of"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "the House of Representatives, two hundred and twenty-five thousand"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Two last sums"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "applicable only"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "to ordinary exp."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "The two sums last mentioned to be applied to the payment of the"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "ordinary expenditures of the Senate and House of Representatives,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "severally, and to no other purpose."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "President,"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Vice President,"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "and heads of de-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "partments."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the President and Vice President of the United"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "States, the Secretary of State, the Secretary of the Treasury, the Sec-"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "retary of War, the Secretary of the Navy, and the Postmaster General,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "sixty thousand dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Secretary to"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "sign patents for"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "lands. 1833, ch."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "91."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For salary of the secretary to sign patents for public lands, per act"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "of March second, eighteen hundred and thirty-three, one thousand five"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "hundred dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Off. Sec. State,"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "clerks, &c."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For clerks and messengers in the office of the Secretary of State,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "twenty thousand three hundred dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Contingent"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "expenses."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For the contingent expenses of the Department of State, including"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "publishing and distributing the laws, twenty-five thousand dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Supdt. and"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "watchman."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For the superintendent and watchman of the northeast executive"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "building, one thousand five hundred dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Contingent"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "expenses."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For contingent expenses of said building, including fuel, labor, oil,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "and repairs, three thousand three hundred and fifty dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Off. Sec. Treas."
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "clerks, &c."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the clerks and messengers in the office of the"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "Secretary of the Treasury, sixteen thousand four hundred and fifty"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Additional"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "clerks, 1836,"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "ch. 115."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the clerks in said office, per act of twenty-third"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "of June, eighteen hundred and thirty-six, three thousand six hundred"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "1st Comptrol-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "ler."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the First Comptroller of the Treasury, three"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "thousand five hundred dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Clerks and"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "messengers."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the clerks and messengers in the office of the"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "First Comptroller, nineteen thousand three hundred dollars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "2d Comptrol-"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "ler."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the Second Comptroller, three thousand dol-"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "lars;"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "Clerks and"
    },
    {
     "role": "sidenote",
     "text": "messenger."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "text": "For compensation to the clerks and messenger in the office of the"
