  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "SEC. 2. And be it further enacted, That all causes transferred by"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "authority of said act from the said district courts to the circuit court,"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "directed by law to be held in the town of Lewisburg, in the State of"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Virginia, and which remain undetermined, be removed back to the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "district courts from whence they were transferred, to be there finally"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "determined."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Appellate ju-"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "risdiction from"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "said dist. courts"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "to be exercised"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "by circuit court"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "at Lewisburg."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "SEC. 3. And be it further enacted, That appellate jurisdiction from"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "the judgments or decrees of the said district courts of the western dis-"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "trict of Virginia, as now authorized by law, shall be exercised by the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "said circuit court at Lewisburg."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "APPROVED, March 28, 1838."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "STATUTE II."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "April 6, 1838."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "[Obsolete.]"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "CHAP. LIV.—An Act making appropriations for the civil and diplomatic expenses"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "of Government for the year eighteen hundred and thirty-eight."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Be it enacted by the Senate and House of Representatives of the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "United States of America in Congress assembled, That the following"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "sums be, and the same are hereby, appropriated, to be paid out of any"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "unappropriated money in the treasury, viz:"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Pay and mile-"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "age of members"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "of Congress."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "For pay and mileage of the members of Congress and delegates,"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "five hundred and sixty-seven thousand six hundred and eighty dollars;"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Pay of officers,"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "&c., of Con-"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "gress."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "For pay of the officers and clerks of the Senate and House of Repre-"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "sentatives, forty thousand four hundred dollars;"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Contingent"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "exp. of Senate."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "For stationery, fuel, printing, and all other contingent expenses of"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "the Senate, fifty thousand dollars;"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Contingent"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "expenses of Ho."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Reps."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "For stationery, fuel, printing, and all other contingent expenses of"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "the House of Representatives, two hundred and twenty-five thousand"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "dollars;"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Two last sums"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "applicable only"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "to ordinary exp."
  },
